  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About&#x3a; Track A auto-STP. Picks IMPS breaks that are RC-91 timeouts (or deemed failures)&#xd;&#xa;with an amount below the auto-refund threshold, builds a Finacle reversal request for each&#xd;&#xa;and posts it to the core banking reversal API with no manual touch. Other breaks are left&#xd;&#xa;for the HITL dispatcher.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Params&#x3a; Breaks file, auto-refund threshold (INR), Finacle reversal endpoint.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Output&#x3a; Reversal_Audit_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx (every request and HTTP outcome) attached to the result.&#xd;&#xa;Complete when all reversals post, Failure if Finacle rejects any, Diverted if none eligible.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Errors&#x3a; Unreachable API rows go down the error hop to the error log and&#xd;&#xa;Reversal_API_Errors_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx and end with Failure; malformed input rows also end with Failure.</note>
      <xloc>608</xloc>
